	<dc:source xml:lang="en">SADIO Electronic Journal of Informatics and Operations Research; Vol. 11 (2012): Special Issue dedicated to ASSE 2011 (Argentine Symposium on Software Engineering); 31-48</dc:source>
	<dc:source xml:lang="es">SADIO Electronic Journal of Informatics and Operations Research; Vol. 11 (2012): Special Issue dedicated to ASSE 2011 (Argentine Symposium on Software Engineering); 31-48</dc:source>
