	<dc:source xml:lang="en">SADIO Electronic Journal of Informatics and Operations Research; Vol. 14 (2015): Special Issue dedicated to ASSE 2014 (Argentine Symposium on Software Engineering); 42-55</dc:source>
	<dc:source xml:lang="es">SADIO Electronic Journal of Informatics and Operations Research; Vol. 14 (2015): Special Issue dedicated to ASSE 2014 (Argentine Symposium on Software Engineering); 42-55</dc:source>
